cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SAMLab in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: SAMLab - Submarine Acoustic Monitoring Laboratory
abstract: "SAMLab is a cross-platform graphical software package for analysing, visualising, and reporting results from long-term Passive Acoustic Monitoring (PAM) campaigns. The software provides an extensible plugin framework for species-specific detectors and custom analysis workflows, enabling scalable processing and review of large acoustic datasets."
type: software

